  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/sdc02_4kings_a_04.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_01",
      "hash64": "12D4F15DCDC65696",
      "text": "So...[VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_02",
      "hash64": "12D4F05DCDC654E3",
      "text": "I take it there’s some messy history between you\\nand Kieran, huh?[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_03",
      "hash64": "12D4EF5DCDC65330",
      "text": "And it sure seems like Drayton’s cookin’ up\\nsomething fishy, too...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_04",
      "hash64": "12D4F65DCDC65F15",
      "text": "Gaaah! Everything’s getting so complicated!\\nCan’t you all just get over yourselves?![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_05",
      "hash64": "12D4F55DCDC65D62",
      "text": "If you wanna say something, just say it! If you\\nwanna do something, just do it![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_06",
      "hash64": "12D4F45DCDC65BAF",
      "text": "I’m not the kinda guy who wastes time sweating\\nthe small stuff![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_07",
      "hash64": "12D4F35DCDC659FC",
      "text": "I battle because I wanna battle! And you know\\nwhat? That’s how it should be![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_08",
      "hash64": "12D4FA5DCDC665E1",
      "text": "I’m Crispin, the Elite Four rep in this here\\nSavanna Biome![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_09",
      "hash64": "12D4F95DCDC6642E",
      "text": "I wanna win, so that’s exactly what I’ll do![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_19",
      "hash64": "12D1755DCDC34E0B",
      "text": "Wooo! That was amazing! We cranked the heat\\nall the way up, eh, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_10",
      "hash64": "12D16C5DCDC33EC0",
      "text": "I love battles and I love cooking ’cause they’re\\nboth so easy to understand![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_11",
      "hash64": "12D16D5DCDC34073",
      "text": "In battles, you either win or you lose! With\\ncooking, your dish is either spicy or not spicy!\\c\\nSimple, right?[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_12",
      "hash64": "12D16E5DCDC34226",
      "text": "But right now, the mood in the League Club\\nfeels...I dunno, off. It’s so frustrating...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_13",
      "hash64": "12D16F5DCDC343D9",
      "text": "I wish I knew how we could go back to bein’ the\\nfun club we were before...[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_14",
      "hash64": "12D1705DCDC3458C",
      "text": "But hey, didn’t mean to douse the flames there.\\nYou were real strong, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_15",
      "hash64": "12D1715DCDC3473F",
      "text": "Lemme see if I can transfer the burning heat\\nfrom our battle to my frying pan!\\c\\nI’ll whip you up something great![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_16",
      "hash64": "12D1725DCDC348F2",
      "text": "Here, I’ll also give you one of my favorite moves\\nto serve up in battle.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_17",
      "hash64": "12D1735DCDC34AA5",
      "text": "I’ve got no clue how to manage the temperature\\nof anything besides what I’m cooking.[VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_firebb_18",
      "hash64": "12D1745DCDC34C58",
      "text": "So all I can say is...crank up the heat all you want\\nin the BB League, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0047)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0047"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_4kings_a_04_clerk_npc",
      "hash64": "98731273EA013D0D",
      "text": "Congratulations on your victory against Crispin\\nof the Elite Four!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
